           Island Systems Demonstration Instructions
           =========================================

Increase your productivity with the object-Menu application framework!
object-Menu allows you to quickly create a complete application for DOS,
Microsoft Windows or Microsoft Windows NT using an intuitive object
oriented architecture.


The following demonstration programs are available as an overview of the
product capabilities.  For more information see the file about.txt.


1. omdemo.exe  protected mode DOS program overviews several product features.

2. dpaint.exe  real mode DOS program demonstrates varied styling:
               in this case, a Microsoft Windows look-alike

3. paint.exe   Microsoft Windows program demonstrates the sample paint
               application running as a native Windows app.

4. broch.exe   Microsoft Windows program demonstrates a simple interface
               running in Windows.  Source code is provided in demsrc.cpp.

               TAKE A LOOK AT DEMSRC.CPP - THIS IS THE CLEAREST AND SMALLEST
               MULTI-PLATFORM OOP CODE IN THE INDUSTRY!

5. float.exe   Microsoft Windows program demonstrates some of the
               advanced capabilities and dynamic nature of object-Menu.
               Source code is provided in float.cpp.


